sequenceDiagram
    actor User

    participant NC as NotificationsController (GUI-BRAP)
    participant NPS as INotificationProxyService
    participant ANC as NotificationsController (API)
    participant NS as INotificationService
    participant NR as INotificationRepository
    participant DB as Database

    User->>NC: GET /Notifications?page=1

    Note over NC: accountId = User.GetAccountId()

    NC->>NPS: GetNotificationsForUserAsync(accountId)

    NPS->>ANC: GET /api/notifications/user/{accountId}

    ANC->>NS: GetNotificationsForUser(accountId)

    NS->>NR: GetNotificationsByUser(accountId)

    NR->>DB: SELECT Notifications WHERE Recipient.PamUserId = account.PamUserId ORDER BY Id DESC

    DB-->>NR: rows

    NR-->>NS: ImmutableList of Notification

    Note over NS: notificationMapper.ToDTO(notification) each item

    NS-->>ANC: ImmutableList of NotificationDTO

    ANC-->>NPS: 200 OK (IReadOnlyList of NotificationDTO)

    Note over NPS: Deserialize response body

    NPS-->>NC: IReadOnlyList of NotificationDTO

    Note over NC: Skip((page-1)*3).Take(3) - set ViewData pagination values

    NC-->>User: View(paginatedNotifications)
